<section class="shell legal"><h1>Self-Drive Vehicle Rental Terms</h1>
<h2>Driver Eligibility</h2><p>A valid driving licence and legally required documents are mandatory.</p>
<h2>Vehicle Damage</h2><p><strong>The customer is responsible for damage occurring during the rental period due to negligence, misuse, accidents, unauthorized driving, traffic violations, or breach of this agreement.</strong></p>
<p>If insurance covers part of the loss, the customer remains responsible for deductibles, exclusions, and any amount not covered by insurance.</p>
<h2>Accidents</h2><p>Any accident, theft or damage must be reported immediately.</p>
<h2>Prohibited Use</h2><ul><li>Racing</li><li>Illegal activities</li><li>Overloading</li><li>Driving under the influence</li><li>Allowing unauthorized drivers</li></ul>
<h2>Traffic Violations</h2><p>The customer is responsible for traffic fines, tolls, parking penalties and towing charges incurred during the rental period.</p></section>
